          "caption": "My last trip this week was around Mount Wanggameti, East Sumba, conducting a survey of several potential habitats for wild birds. Nice to meet this handsome creature. Birds in the Falconidae family are partly known by the people of East Sumba as \"Kapaha\". Alap-alap sapi (Falco moluccensis) is a type of raptor with a small size. The inhabitants of Sumba Island are a subspecies of \"microbalius\"",
